WEBVTT

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:30.560
it's not the loud party or the bar where
you have to make clever, cool small talk.

00:15:30.584 --> 00:15:32.711
Like, if you put me in an IMAX theater,

00:15:32.735 --> 00:15:36.820
and you were going to show me
some drama documentary of the universe

00:15:36.844 --> 00:15:41.863
with 3-D effects
and sound up at the maximum

00:15:41.887 --> 00:15:45.743
and all these amazing,
unexpected visual stimuli coming in,

00:15:45.767 --> 00:15:49.232
I would say, "Bring it on,
that's thrilling. I love that!"

00:15:49.256 --> 00:15:51.367
Totally open to that.

00:15:51.391 --> 00:15:55.402
But it's just the party afterwards
that I might shy away from.

00:15:55.426 --> 00:15:56.810
So, is that in the science?

00:15:56.834 --> 00:15:59.320
Is that talked about and understood,

00:15:59.344 --> 00:16:03.048
the difference between social stimulation
versus just any type of stimulation?